The below are my beliefs, I have not done any code-diving, but in
practice, they have been true - so far.

Your character can be satiated if he overeats.  It will show a status
of satiated.  However, he can also be "over-satiated".  You will still
see this as a status of "Satiated", but you will always get a warning
message such as "You're having a hard time getting it all down".  If
you can't finish the meal without choking, you will have an
opportunity to stop, provided you were not "over-satiated" when you
started your meal.

Bottom line:  If you have a status of "Satiated" and did not get a
warning message like the above, then you are not "over-satiated", and
you will always get a chance to stop eating if you try to eat
something else.

